diff --git a/MERGE_NOTES.md b/MERGE_NOTES.md
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..8cc62a99d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/MERGE_NOTES.md
@@ -0,0 +1,89 @@
+# MERGE_NOTES — luce-dflash-turbomerge
+
+Merge of `TheTom/llama-cpp-turboquant` @ `feature/turboquant-kv-cache` (73eb521da, 2026-06-10)
+into `Luce-Org/llama.cpp-dflash-ggml` @ `luce-dflash` (570d9785e, 2026-06-07).
+Common ancestor: upstream `fae3a2807` (2026-04-14). Merged: 2026-06-11.
+
+Re-apply this ledger when syncing either parent.
+
+## Renamed symbols (Lucebox side renamed; TurboQuant keeps canonical names)
+
+| Was (luce-dflash) | Now | Where |
+|---|---|---|
+| `GGML_TYPE_TQ3_0 = 42` | `= 47` (`GGML_TYPE_COUNT = 48`) | ggml/include/ggml.h |
+| `GGML_OP_TURBO_WHT` (plain FWHT) | `GGML_OP_TURBO_WHT_PLAIN` | ggml.h, ggml.c, ggml-cpu.c, ggml-cuda.cu |
+| `ggml_turbo_wht(ctx, a, direction)` (3-arg) | `ggml_turbo_wht_plain` | ggml.h, ggml.c |
+| `ggml_cuda_op_turbo_wht` / `_quantize` | `ggml_cuda_op_turbo_wht_plain` / `_plain_quantize` | ggml-cuda.cu, turbo-wht-plain.{cu,cuh} |
+| `turbo-wht.{cu,cuh}` (Lucebox file) | `turbo-wht-plain.{cu,cuh}` | ggml/src/ggml-cuda/ |
+| `LLAMA_VOCAB_PRE_TYPE_LAGUNA = 51` | `= 53` (TQ's SARVAM_MOE=51, MINICPM5=52 keep their slots) | src/llama-vocab.h |
+
+TQ's 5-arg `ggml_turbo_wht(ctx, a, direction, group_size, scale)` and type slots 42–46
+(`TURBO2_0`, `TURBO3_0`, `TURBO4_0`, `TQ3_1S`, `TQ4_1S`) are unchanged — existing TQ GGUFs
+and KV caches stay valid. Lucebox TQ3_0 is KV-cache-only, so its renumbering is safe.
+
+## gated_delta_net.cu — unioned kernel
+
+Template is now `<int S_v, bool KDA, bool TREE_MODE, bool keep_rs_t, typename InterT>`.
+- `TREE_MODE`/`InterT`/`parent_ids`/`persist_inter`: Lucebox dflash tree-verify + rollback.
+- `keep_rs_t`/`K`: TurboQuant per-token state snapshots (K slots).
+- The two features are runtime-disjoint and asserted so
+  (`keep_rs` ⇒ no `parent_ids`, no `persist_inter`).
+- Mode detection (must stay in sync between `ggml.c::ggml_gated_delta_net` and the CUDA host):
+  state tensor 3D `(S_v*S_v*H, K, n_seqs)` with K>1 ⇒ keep_rs; anything else ⇒ K=1.
+- dst layout: keep_rs ⇒ `[attn | K slots]`; otherwise ⇒ `[attn | final | per-token intermediates]`.
+- Input-state offset uses TQ's K-aware formula `seq*K*H*S_v² + h*S_v²`, which reduces to the
+  base 2D layout at K=1, so chain/tree launches are unchanged.
+
+## Other landmines fixed (auto-merge produced silently broken code here)
+
+- `ggml.c` `GGML_OP_NAME`/`GGML_OP_SYMBOL`: auto-merge left duplicate `"TURBO_WHT"` and
+  dropped `MOE_FUSED` (Lucebox's table was already one short upstream). Tables rebuilt,
+  `GGML_OP_COUNT == 100` asserts updated (96 base + 3 Lucebox + 1 TQ).
+- `ggml-cpu/ggml-cpu.c` and `ggml-cuda.cu` had duplicate `case GGML_OP_TURBO_WHT:` labels in
+  the same switch (one per side) — Lucebox's renamed to `_PLAIN`.
+- `llama-kv-cache.cpp`: dropped Lucebox's unconditional `attn_rot_{k,v}` assignment (it would
+  have overridden TQ's off-by-default policy and double-rotated TURBO types). The
+  `LLAMA_ATTN_ROT_{K,V}_OVERRIDE` env paths now exclude all self-rotating types
+  (TQ3_0, TURBO2/3/4_0).
+- `ssm-conv.cu`: tree mode (Lucebox) asserts `!fuse_bias` (TQ's fusion) — union not supported.
+
+## Structural choices
+
+- Took TQ's model-classes refactor (`llama_model_base`, per-arch `models/*.cpp`,
+  `conversion/` python package, `file(GLOB)` model sources). Ported Lucebox's laguna arch:
+  `llama_model_laguna` (models.h + laguna.cpp methods `load_arch_hparams`,
+  `load_arch_tensors`, `build_arch_graph` → `llm_build_laguna`), factory case in
+  `llama-model.cpp::llama_model_mapping`, `LagunaModel` in `conversion/llama.py`.
+- `common/CMakeLists.txt`: kept upstream `build_info` target; TQ's `llama-common-base`
+  references retargeted.
+- fattn-vec.cuh: TQ3_0 added to `K_is_unquantized` (float-Q path) — preserves Lucebox's
+  graph-FWHT rotation contract under TQ's restructured constexpr config.
+
+## Inherited from parents (no merge work needed)
+
+- Upstream MTP speculative decoding (`--spec-type mtp`) — came in via TQ's branch.
+- Lucebox: DFlash tree verify, pFlash sparse prefill, laguna arch, MMQ stream-k OOB fix.
+- TQ: turbo2/3/4 KV cache, TQ3_1S/TQ4_1S weight quants, InnerQ, Metal/Vulkan turbo backends.
+
+## Post-merge additions (this branch, beyond both parents)
+
+- `laguna.cpp` adapted to TQ's `build_attn` signature (new `wo_s` param).
+- **TQ3_0 graph contract wired into libllama** (`src/llama-graph.cpp`, 5 sites): forward
+  `ggml_turbo_wht_plain` on Q when K=TQ3_0, inverse on attention output when V=TQ3_0,
+  mirroring the TURBO* hook pattern. On both parent branches `-ctk tq3_0` produced garbage
+  in llama-cli/llama-server because the rotation contract existed only in the lucebox-hub
+  dflash harness graphs. Requires head_dim % 128 == 0 and full GPU offload
+  (TURBO_WHT_PLAIN is CUDA-only).
+
+## Verified (RTX 3060, sm_60+sm_86 fatbin, 2026-06-11)
+
+- `test-quantize-fns`: clean (tq3_0/tq3_1s/tq4_1s round-trip; turbo2/3/4 skipped by design —
+  rotated-domain KV quants are validated at runtime instead).
+- qwen35 (hybrid gated-delta-net) 0.8B: coherent greedy generation with `-ctk/-ctv` turbo4,
+  turbo3, tq3_0 (after wiring), q8_0 control. Exercises the merged GDN kernel chain path.
+- KV-type CLI names: `turbo2|turbo3|turbo4|tq3_0` (not `turbo4_0`).
+
+## CPU-backend caveat
+
+`GGML_OP_TURBO_WHT_PLAIN` is CUDA-only (asserts on CPU), as on luce-dflash.
+TQ's CPU turbo path is intact. Don't run TQ3_0 KV cache on CPU-only builds.
